  #line-at(233.33pt, 397.73pt, "-domain MBPA in the front-side geometry (FSD) detection ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 413.57pt, "mode, as extensively reported in [20], utilizes two separate (by means of wavelength and ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 429.41pt, "modulation frequency) scanning beams routed by a dichroic mirror to a sample sealed in a ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 445.25pt, "photoacoustic chamber (Fig. 1a). A cumulative PA signal recorded by a microphone is passed ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 461.23pt, "to two lock-in units and analysed with respect to the reference modulation frequency provided ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 477.07pt, "by a two-channel function generator driving the LEDs. It is understood that the magnitudes of ")
