  #line-at(70.824pt, 637.87pt, "varied and minimized by a proper materials selection or chemical modification of the pigments ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 653.86pt, "analysed. Then, the magnitude of the direct contribution can be quantified upon Fresnel model ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 669.7pt, "for the reflection and transmission of light. In brief, for a non-polarized light (as in case of ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 685.54pt, "LEDs) the effective reflectivity of a material is given by an average of the s- and p-type ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 701.38pt, "reflectivities, and depends on the refractive indices (")
