  #line-at(70.824pt, 129.38pt, "of light intensity, pigment concentration and the light-matter interaction cross-section via the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 145.22pt, "light absorption coefficient, and the thermal deactivation efficiency coefficient. In the ")
